{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02695","headline":"入蜀秋夜宿江渚 · 陈子良","name":"入蜀秋夜宿江渚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我行逢日暮，弭櫂独维舟。\n水雾一边起，风林两岸秋。\n山阴黑断碛，月影素寒流。\n故乡千里外，何以慰羁愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子良","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02695.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02695","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}